{# The privacy policy's paragraph on Google Maps, included by privacy-policy.en.html.twig when it draws the site's maps (see MapProviderInterface); a provider handing nothing to a third party ships none #}
<h3 data-legal-id="third-parties.google-maps">Maps (Google Maps)</h3>
<div>
	Maps are displayed by Google Maps, only once you have accepted third-party content. Google then receives your IP address and may set its own cookies.
</div>
